ONE POINT TO CLARIFY WITH THE TEAM

The email mentions:

Release Bug
        │
        ▼
Deploy to SIT
        │
        ▼
Deploy to UAT

This works correctly only if SIT is validating the Release branch.

Question to ask:

"When validating release bug fixes in SIT, do we deploy the Release branch itself to SIT, or is SIT already running the latest Development branch containing Sprint4 and Sprint5?"

If SIT always deploys the Release branch, then the proposed strategy is sound.

