FINAL UNDERSTANDING

This strategy allows:

✔ Continuous feature development
✔ Stable release testing
✔ Parallel Sprint development
✔ Safe UAT bug fixing
✔ Promotion of the same artifact across environments
✔ No code loss through back merge
✔ Future releases automatically include previous release bug fixes
✔ Alignment with standard GitFlow release management